OL,3,GNEWSAPet Shop Boys and Biffy Clyro to  
OL,4,Aheadline Tramlines 2027                
OL,6,FPet Shop Boys, Biffy Clyro and Two Door
OL,7,FCinema Club will headline Sheffield's  
OL,8,FTramlines music festival next summer,  
OL,9,Forganisers have confirmed.             
OL,11,FThe festival, first held in 2009 and   
OL,12,Fwhich this year welcomed about 40,000  
OL,13,Fmusic fans, will take place in         
OL,14,FHillsborough Park in Sheffield between 
OL,15,F23-25 July.                            
OL,17,FOther artists on the bill include The  
OL,18,FKooks, Ash, Natalie Imbruglia, Inhaler,
OL,19,FGroove Armada, Vengaboys and           
OL,20,FRazorlight.                            
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
