OL,3,GNEWSAPet Shop Boys and Biffy Clyro to  
OL,4,Aheadline Tramlines 2027                
OL,6,FTimm Cleasby, Tramlines operations     
OL,7,Fdirector, said: "Line-up time is a     
OL,8,Freally exciting time for us. I'm       
OL,9,Fexcited for this year's festival."     
